  "plain": "A documentary filmmaker named James Fox talks about events in January 1996 in Varginha, Brazil, where a strange living creature is said to have been captured and taken to the city's regional hospital. Fox says that, as he understands it from doctors including Italo Venturelli, a surgeon named Marcos Vinicius Neves operated on the being, which had swelling from a head injury, to relieve the pressure. If true, it would mean Brazilian doctors gave medical treatment to a live non-human creature."
